    "q-326970": {
      "dom_id": "step-q326970",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "What number is $15%$ less than $80?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find a number $15%$ *less than* $80,$ we apply a new percentage of\n\n$$\n100%-15%=85%.\n$$\n\nWe begin by converting the percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n85%=\\frac{85}{100}=0.85\n$$\n\nSo, to find a number that is $85%$ of $80,$ we multiply $80$ by $0.85:$\n\n$$\n0.85\\cdot 80=68\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
